    {
      "id": "p0265-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the world of Underta/e, important things come in threes. The monsters, the humans, and the player. The three members of the Dreemur family. The three entities vying for control of the main character's body. Three main story routes. Three triangles in the Delta Rune. And so on.",
        "raw": "In the world of Underta/e, important things come in threes. The monsters, the\nhumans, and the player. The three members of the Dreemur family. The three\nentities vying for control of the main character's body. Three main story routes.\nThree triangles in the Delta Rune. And so on.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10572875,
          0.09065714,
          0.709602,
          0.15813571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09879391,
          0.08994286,
          0.71160919,
          0.15920714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "在《Undertale》的世界里，重要的事物常常以三为一组：怪物、人类和玩家；Dreemurr 家的三位成员；争夺主角身体控制权的三个存在；三条主要故事路线；Delta Rune 中的三个三角形，等等。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.10640116,
          0.08922857,
          0.709602,
          0.16170714
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.46867143285714286,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left"
      },
      "calibration": {
