      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0265-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "As I finish this book, I now see that the number three is important in localization too. Specifically, I see that there are three sides to any successful localization: the creator's side, the localizer's side, and the audience's side. Without all three sides, the final localization will be flawed, incomplete, or meaningless. If even one side is weak, the final localization will feel weak too. But if all three sides are present and solid, the resulting localization will shine brightly. I believe this holds true not just for games, but for any form of artistic transformation.",
        "raw": "As I finish this book, I now see that the number three is important in\nlocalization too. Specifically, I see that there are three sides to any successful\nlocalization: the creator's side, the localizer's side, and the audience's side.\nWithout all three sides, the final localization will be flawed, incomplete, or\nmeaningless. If even one side is weak, the final localization will feel weak too.\nBut if all three sides are present and solid, the resulting localization will shine\nbrightly. I believe this holds true not just for games, but for any form of artistic\ntransformation.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10442408,
          0.17245,
          0.70317899,
          0.31360714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09879391,
          0.17173571,
          0.71160919,
          0.31467857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          6,
          7,
          8,
          9,
          10,
          13,
          15,
          17
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "写到本书结尾，我发现“三”在本地化中也很重要。一次成功的本地化需要三方：创作者、本地化人员和受众。缺了任何一方，最终的本地化就会有缺陷、不完整，甚至失去意义。即使只有一方薄弱，成品也会显得薄弱。但如果三方齐备、各自扎实，最终的本地化就能大放异彩。我相信，这不仅适用于游戏，也适用于任何形式的艺术转化。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
