    {
      "id": "p0265-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "On occasion, I'll finish a lengthy localization analysis with some sort of final score or rating. I don't think that would be appropriate this time, given my personal involvement with the project. Instead, I'll just say that all three sides of Underta/e's Japanese localization are solid: the localization team brought experience and passion, Toby brought care and excitement, and the players brought support and respect. Without a doubt, Underta/e's Japanese localization is filled with DETERMINATION.",
        "raw": "On occasion, I'll finish a lengthy localization analysis with some sort of final\nscore or rating. I don't think that would be appropriate this time, given my\npersonal involvement with the project. Instead, I'll just say that all three\nsides of Underta/e's Japanese localization are solid: the localization team\nbrought experience and passion, Toby brought care and excitement, and the\nplayers brought support and respect. Without a doubt, Underta/e's Japanese\nlocalization is filled with DETERMINATION.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10707357,
          0.32925,
          0.68514439,
          0.45248571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09879391,
          0.32853571,
          0.71160919,
          0.45355714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          19,
          20,
          21,
          22,
          23,
          24,
          25
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "有时，我会在一篇长篇本地化分析的末尾给出评分或评价。但这次我亲自参与了项目，觉得这样做不太合适。我只想说，《Undertale》日语本地化的三方都很扎实：本地化团队带来了经验与热情，Toby 带来了用心与兴奋，玩家带来了支持与尊重。毫无疑问，《Undertale》的日语本地化充满了决心。",
        "status": "draft",
