    {
      "id": "p0265-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "First, why do you think it's called \"localization\" and not something else like \"globalization\", \"regionalization\", or \"culturalization\"? Is there a better name that would work instead? The term \"localization\" is still relatively new and in flux, so who knows, maybe it'll go by a different name someday.",
        "raw": "First, why do you think it's called \"localization\" and not something else like\n\"globalization\", \"regionalization\", or \"culturalization\"? Is there a better name\nthat would work instead? The term \"localization\" is still relatively new and in\nflux, so who knows, maybe it'll go by a different name someday.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.1008011,
          0.53134286,
          0.69674595,
          0.59883571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09879391,
          0.53062857,
          0.71160919,
          0.59990714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          28,
          29,
          30,
          31
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "第一，你觉得为什么叫“本地化”（localization），不叫“全球化”（globalization）、“地区化”（regionalization）或“文化化”（culturalization）？有没有更合适的名称？“本地化”这个术语还比较新，也在变化。谁知道呢，说不定将来会换个名字。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
