    {
      "id": "p0265-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "My second challenge to you is this: the next time you watch your favorite movie, read your favorite book, or listen to your favorite music, keep an eye out for things that would be lost in a straightforward, literal translation into another language. Then come up with a way to localize it somehow. Think of it as a game. Or a bad time. Nyehehe!",
        "raw": "My second challenge to you is this: the next time you watch your favorite\nmovie, read your favorite book, or listen to your favorite music, keep an eye\nout for things that would be lost in a straightforward, literal translation into\nanother language. Then come up with a way to localize it somehow. Think of it\nas a game. Or a bad time. Nyehehe!",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.10723414,
          0.61382143,
          0.7057783,
          0.70054286
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09879391,
          0.61310714,
          0.71160919,
          0.70161429
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          32,
          33,
          34,
          35,
          36
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "第二道挑战是：下次看你最喜欢的电影、读你最喜欢的书，或听你最喜欢的音乐时，留意哪些东西会在直白、逐字的外语翻译中丢失，再想办法把它们本地化。把这当成一场游戏吧。也可能是一段苦日子。捏嘿嘿！",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
